            "notes": "## Round 1 \u2013 Opening Strategy  \n\nStart by focusing on burst damage and punishing low-HP enemies. After landing a **[Take Aim]** bolt, keep your crosshair locked on the target to maximize follow-up pressure. This allows you to quickly delete squishies or finish off weakened opponents.  \n\nAt this stage, don\u2019t worry too much about ability resets or ammo refunds. The scaling isn\u2019t strong enough yet for those mechanics to feel impactful. Instead, concentrate on clean hits, farming safely, and picking off stragglers to set up your momentum for later rounds.",
