            "notes": "## Round 2 \u2013 Scaling Burst  \n\nThe strategy remains the same: **punish squishies and chase down low-HP enemies**. What changes this round is your raw output \u2014 with more weapon power, your crossbow shots hit noticeably harder, making every **[Take Aim]** connection even deadlier.  \n\nThe added range from **[Quick Dash]** gives you more flexibility:  \n- Use it to **evade dives** or kite melee threats.  \n- **Disengage entirely** if the fight isn\u2019t in your favor.  \n- Apply **greater pressure** by dashing forward to chase enemies and secure kills before they escape.  \n\nThis round is all about **doubling down on your damage** while adding mobility to both survive longer trades and aggressively finish off targets. If you play it smart, you can take risky angles, secure picks, and then slip away before enemies collapse on you.",
