            "notes": "## Round 3 \u2013 Infinite Ammo Unlocks  \n\nThis is the round where the build really starts to shine. With **Redux**, every **[Revdraw Crossbow]** hit against a target stuck by **[Take Aim]** or **[Bola Shot]** refunds 1 ammo and reduces ability cooldowns. This means you can stay engaged much longer and apply **sustained pressure** instead of short bursts.  \n\nThe key is to **start your combos with [Take Aim] or [Bola Shot]**, then unload crossbow shots to trigger the ammo refunds. Done correctly, this creates a near-loop that keeps your momentum going.  \n\nYour weapon power continues to scale, and **Codebreaker** lets you ignore armor, making even tankier enemies vulnerable. Paired with cooldown reduction from **Icy Coolant**, you can chase more aggressively or reset defensively as needed.  \n\nAt this stage, you\u2019re no longer just looking for opportunistic picks \u2014 you can **control fights through relentless pressure**, forcing the enemy team to respect your presence. Squishies remain your priority, but even bruisers start to feel the burn.",
